  "title": "Carrot Pineapple Cupcakes",
  "description": "These deliciously moist carrot-pineapple cupcakes are frosted with cream cheese frosting and are much easier to make than traditional carrot cake.",
  "authors": [
    "Larissa Bergen Smith"
  ],
